---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mini Clinics"
  description="AZPVA Mini Clinics — small-group vault sessions with 3–5 athletes (NCAA-safe sizing), same pricing as semi-privates. Dates published 14 days ahead."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Training options</p>
      <h1>Mini Clinics</h1>
      <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85)">
        Small-group sessions with a minimum of 3 and a maximum of 5 vaulters — structured to stay NCAA-compliant for coaching staff.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        Mini Clinics are similar to semi-privates: focused technique work in a small group, with the same package pricing.
        The key difference is group size — <strong>at least 3 and no more than 5 athletes</strong> — so sessions stay within NCAA-safe limits when Garrett is coaching.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li>Minimum 3 / maximum 5 vaulters per session</li>
        <li>Same cost structure as semi-privates (packages available — ask staff)</li>
        <li>Dates published at least <strong>14 days in advance</strong></li>
        <li>Every session is coached</li>
        <li>Access to AZPVA pole inventory</li>
        <li>Independent AZPVA programming (not an ASU practice, tryout, or recruiting visit)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Upcoming dates</h2>
      <p>First published Mini Clinic times:</p>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li><strong>Friday, October 2</strong> — 5:00–6:30 PM</li>
        <li><strong>Friday, October 16</strong> — 5:00–6:30 PM</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted">
        Additional dates will be posted about two weeks ahead. Call to reserve a spot — sessions need at least three athletes to run.
      </p>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:+14807666017"><strong>(480) 766-6017</strong></a> to book.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
